        "Id1": {
            "text": "Carroll County, Maryland is southeast of Adams County, Pennsylvania and Pennsylvania's Cumberland County is to the north. Adams County is where stands the 11th Mississippi Infantry Monument, which is categorised as a contributing property. The monument is placed in the municipality of Gettysburg."
        },
        "Id2": {
            "text": "The 11th Mississippi Infantry Monument is in Adams County, in the municipality of Gettysburg, Pennsylvania. Adams County has Cumberland County to its north and to its southeast, Carroll County, Maryland. The 11th Mississippi Infantry Monument falls under the category of contributing property."
        }
